d 'EV': module to mimic EViews-style expressions in estimation commands
d
d  The ev command enables Stata users to write intuitive,
d EViews-style	algebraic and lag expressions directly inside
d standard Stata estimation  commands. This ease the learning
d curve,  minimizes the need for manual variable generation, and
d makes it easier for  researchers to replicate models across
d software platforms. 
d
d KW: EViews
d KW: data transformations
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261112
d
d Author:   Matthew Yeung,   Hong Kong Metropolitan University
d Support: email  myeung@@hkmu.edu.hk
d
d Author:  Aaron Tao,   Hong Kong Metropolitan University
d Support: email NA
d
f ev.ado
f ev.sthlp
f ev_examples.do
